msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:84
msgid ""
"The droid started to attack objects in its proximity! That way, more "
"fragments will be created that may harm other ships. You must stop it! "
"Instruct your ship crew that they should NOT destroy it, they should target "
"its impulse drive instead."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:116
msgid "A deactivated military droid. Scan to get the capturing frequency."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:116
msgid "Capturing frequency:"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:116
msgid ""
"Set your shield frequency to match the capturing frequency and activate your "
"shields to capture the droid."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:133
msgid "Droid captured."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:134
#, lua-format
msgid "The malfunctioning old droid was captured by %s."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:152
msgctxt "buttonGM"
msgid "Droid Showdown"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:181 mod/plot_shattered.lua:183
msgid ""
"This is the command node that controls the rogue droids. We have to shut it "
"down!"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:186
msgid ""
"Bad news: A whole group of military droids that should have been out of "
"service just woke up. If we don't do anything against them, they will slowly "
"but surely destroy all objects they can find. The debris will spread all "
"over the orbit, destroying all our communications satellites.\n"
"\n"
"They emit heavy electromagnetic-signals. Your radar will show the direction "
"of those signals als wiggling red line.\n"
"    \n"
"Please send a ship to invesitgate."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:202
msgid "An old military droid"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:202
msgid "An old military droid. Capturing frequency is blocked."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:214
msgid ""
"We detected a control node within the group of rougue droids, but a newly "
"formed dust cloud prevents us to get more details. We don't know if this "
"cloud was created intentionally to serve as a hiding place. It might as well "
"be a side effect of their destructive activities or just fuel leaking out of "
"old tanks.\n"
"We have to shut down the rogue droids somehow. Therefore, you need to get a "
"ship as close as possible to the control node that is commanding the droids. "
"Luckily, the droids are in some kind of sleep mode right now.\n"
"Notify nearby ships, that they ship should turn off all non-essential "
"systems and devices as soon as they are getting closer to the dangerous "
"droids."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:245 mod/plot_shattered.lua:246
msgid "Out of reach"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:253 mod/plot_shattered.lua:254
msgid "Connect to control device"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:256 mod/plot_shattered.lua:257
msgid ""
"A droid control device appeared is in range for data transmission. You can "
"connect to it with the button on the right."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:284
msgid ""
"Connection established. Keep near the control node, to not lose connection."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:288 mod/plot_shattered.lua:289
msgid "Connection established."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:307 mod/plot_shattered.lua:308
msgid "Transmitter charging"
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:332
msgid ""
"If not done yet, you should now change the headline of your sidebar from "
"'scan' to 'other', so you can send the signal as soon as it is available."
msgstr ""

#: mod/plot_shattered.lua:333 mod/plot_shattered.lua:334
msgid ""
"As soon as your transmitter is fully charged, the weapons officer has to "
"sync the shields with the transmitter (a Button will appear on the console). "
"Then, Operations will have to send the signal. (There will be a button for "
"this as well.)"
msgstr ""

